{
  "format_version": 2,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "chapter": "prologue",
  "conversations": {
    "q_wake": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你刚才睡得还挺好啊。",
          "next": "p_who",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "met_q",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_who",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "……你是？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_3",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "asked_q_identity",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_3",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "Q。坐你旁边的。你真不记得了？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "who",
              "text": "抱歉，我没想起来。",
              "next": "q_who_1"
            },
            {
              "id": "day",
              "text": "现在几点了？",
              "next": "p_day"
            },
            {
              "id": "silent",
              "text": "（没接话。）",
              "next": "p_silent"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_who_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "平时我挡你的道，你就说一声「让让」。今天还跟我道歉呢。",
          "next": "q_who_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_who_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你是怕见 B 吧？她上生物也得等铃呢。先别替她着急。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_day",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "现在几点了？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_day_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "asked_q_date",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_day_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "快九点。第二遍铃还没打。",
          "next": "q_day_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_day_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "这节是生物，B 的。还来得及把书翻开。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_silent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（你没接话。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_silent_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "stayed_silent",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_silent_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "……行。我又不是来点名的。",
          "next": "q_silent_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_silent_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "这节是生物。等 B 叫你，你再开口也来得及。",
          "next": "p_biology"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_biology",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "生物课？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_exam_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "上学期生物考完，我在门口等你还我橡皮。后来有人说你没来，有人说卷子上就一个名字。",
          "next": "q_exam_2",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "q_claims_blank_exam",
              "source": "reported",
              "speaker": "q",
              "text": "Q 说上学期生物考试结束后在门口等过你。他记不准你是没去，还是交了白卷。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "传来传去，我也记不清最先是谁说的。你还记得吗？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "blank",
              "text": "我交了白卷？",
              "next": "p_blank"
            },
            {
              "id": "absent",
              "text": "我没去考试？",
              "next": "p_absent"
            },
            {
              "id": "none",
              "text": "一点印象也没有。",
              "next": "p_none"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_blank",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "我交了白卷？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_blank_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_blank_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "有张卷子是空的。后面的人说那是你的。我没看清上头的名字。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_absent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "我是没进考场？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_absent_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_absent_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我没等到你。交卷的人挤在一块儿往外走，我又没一个个看。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_none",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一点印象也没有。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_none_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "denied_exam_memory",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_none_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "那先别想了。我那张卷子最后两道一个字没写。平时倒装得挺会。",
          "next": "q_exam_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_exam_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "先过今天这节吧。",
          "next": "q_topic_ask"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_ask",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "她要问生态系统，你千万别等我给你递话。我现在一抬头就忘后半句。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ask",
              "text": "生态系统？",
              "next": "p_topic"
            },
            {
              "id": "silent",
              "text": "（没有回答。）",
              "next": "p_topic_silent"
            },
            {
              "id": "search",
              "text": "（你低头翻找课本。）",
              "next": "p_topic_book"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "生态系统？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_answer",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "就那个。谁吃谁，还得算上它们待的地方。",
          "next": "p_ecosystem_question"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_ecosystem_question",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "光说谁吃谁不行？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_ecosystem"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ecosystem",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "不行吧。它们又不是住在箭头里。还得说水、光什么的，我老漏这一截。",
          "next": "p_ecosystem_reply"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_ecosystem_reply",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "那你先别抬头。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_ecosystem_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ecosystem_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行。念错了你别笑。",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic_silent",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（没有回答。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_silent"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_silent",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行。我再把后半句念一遍。你不用听。",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_topic_book",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（你低头翻找课本。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_topic_book"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_topic_book",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你找书啊？我刚才说的不是让你现在就背。",
          "next": "q_end_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_end_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你先看看书包吧。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.check_bag"
            }
          ],
          "next": "q_end_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_end_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "好啦，先不跟你说了。我得把生物课那几个知识点再背一遍。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_studying": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_studying_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_studying_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "初级消费者……等我把这句背完，行不行？",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_after_bag": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_ab_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_ab_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "没翻到生物书？你平时不是夹在练习册前面吗？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "told",
              "text": "课本不见了。",
              "next": "p_told"
            },
            {
              "id": "accused",
              "text": "是你拿了我的书？",
              "next": "p_accused"
            },
            {
              "id": "never",
              "text": "（不说课本的事。）",
              "next": "p_never"
            },
            {
              "id": "square",
              "text": "讲台上那把尺，不是数学课用的吗？",
              "next": "p_square",
              "conditions": {
                "all_flags": [
                  "saw_set_square"
                ]
              },
              "once": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_told",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "课本不见了。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_told_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "told_q_about_textbook",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_told_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我早上看见你把包放下了。没见你往外拿书。",
          "next": "q_told_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_told_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "那就看我的。你别一下翻到后头，我手指还压着这页。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "share",
              "text": "要用书就跟你合看。",
              "next": "p_q_share",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "q_book_pact"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "witness",
              "text": "你看清是我放的？",
              "next": "p_q_witness",
              "once": true
            },
            {
              "id": "drop",
              "text": "（先不说了。）",
              "next": "q_ab_end"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_accused",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "是你拿了我的书？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_accused_1",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "accused_q",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_accused_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "没拿。跟你借个笔盖你都认得出来，书我往哪儿藏？",
          "next": "q_accused_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_accused_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你要借就开口。别先让我证明这本是我的。",
          "next": "q_ab_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "p_never",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "（不说课本的事。）",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_never_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_never_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行。你不说，我先背我的。",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "q_book_talk_done",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_q_share",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "好。要翻书，我就跟你看一本。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_share"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_share",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你把凳子挪过来就行。先说好，借你看可以，叫到你名字你自己答。",
          "next": "q_ab_end",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "q_book_pact",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_q_witness",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "不是书。我问你看没看清是我。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_witness"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_witness",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我看见一只手，把包往你这儿放。我认出来的是包。……你问的是脸啊？那没有。",
          "next": "q_ab_end",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "q_bag_witness_limits",
              "source": "reported",
              "speaker": "q",
              "text": "Q 起初说看见你放下书包。追问之后，他说只看见一只手把包搁到你座位旁边，没看见脸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_square",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "等一下。讲台上那把尺，不是数学课用的吗？",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_sq_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_sq_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "听说隔壁班数学老师一急，把它摔断了。后来工友又给缠上。你看，黄的那几圈。",
          "next": "q_sq_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_sq_2",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "B 就拿来指食物网。有回她往黑板上一敲，槽里的粉笔头掉了两个。我还以为她会叫我去捡。",
          "next": "q_sq_3",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "q_set_square_use",
              "source": "reported",
              "speaker": "q",
              "text": "Q 说听闻三角尺是隔壁班摔断后修好的。他只说自己见过 B 用它敲黑板。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_sq_3",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "别的我没见过。……刚才说哪儿了？",
          "next": "q_ab_1"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ab_end",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行。让我再背一句，就一句。",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "q_book_talk_done",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "q_after_dismissal": {
      "default_source": "reported",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "q_ad_bell",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "q_ad_bell",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "等我把这页折一下。……好了。",
          "next": "q_ad_present"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ad_present",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "你刚才那声「到」，我听见了。上回我在门口没等着你，回去就说你没来。你要再听见这一句，有可能是我传的。",
          "conditions": {
            "requires": {
              "n_roll_response": "answered_self"
            },
            "not_flags": [
              "q_roll_debriefed"
            ]
          },
          "next": "q_ad_pressed",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "q_repeated_absence_rumor",
              "speaker": "q",
              "source": "reported",
              "text": "你亲自应名后，Q 承认上学期没在门口等到你，就回去跟人说你没参加考试。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ad_pressed",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "下回先问我，别当着讲台问。她低头那一下，我以为要把我名字也填进去了。",
          "conditions": {
            "requires": {
              "n_roll_response": "asked_q"
            },
            "not_flags": [
              "q_roll_debriefed"
            ]
          },
          "next": "q_ad_quiet"
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ad_quiet",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "刚才我嘴都张开了。上回我替你喊，你还说「我又没聋」。这回我没喊。",
          "next": "q_ad_lead",
          "conditions": {
            "requires": {
              "n_roll_response": "silent"
            },
            "not_flags": [
              "q_roll_debriefed"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ad_lead",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "我刚才说他们都出去了。其实就看见前排那俩，往楼梯那头走的。下没下去，我没跟着瞧。",
          "next": "q_ad_1",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": [
              "q_roll_debriefed"
            ]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "q_roll_debriefed",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_ad_1",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "去操场看看？我想知道那俩到底在不在。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "yes",
              "text": "好，一起走。",
              "next": "p_yes"
            },
            {
              "id": "later",
              "text": "你先去吧，我再坐一会儿。",
              "next": "p_later"
            },
            {
              "id": "no",
              "text": "不去了，我想在这儿待着。",
              "next": "p_no"
            },
            {
              "id": "silent",
              "text": "（没回答，继续收拾东西。）",
              "next": "p_silent"
            },
            {
              "id": "look_back_at_square",
              "text": "刚才点名的时候，你看见 N 碰那把尺了吗？",
              "next": "p_ad_square",
              "conditions": {
                "all_flags": [
                  "saw_set_square"
                ]
              },
              "once": true
            },
            {
              "id": "place_sound",
              "text": "把记得的声音和这间教室对一对。",
              "next": "ad_square_check",
              "conditions": {
                "all_flags": [
                  "saw_set_square",
                  "expectation_played",
                  "choice:q_after_dismissal:look_back_at_square"
                ],
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:q_after_dismissal:ad_square_check"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p_yes",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "好，一起走。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_yes",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "free_period_leaving",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "free_period_stayed",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.leave_classroom"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "n_leaving",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你决定趁着自由活动时间离开教室。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_yes",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "那走吧。我在门口等你。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p_later",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你先去吧，我再坐一会儿。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "q_later",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "free_period_stayed",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "free_period_leaving",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.stay_classroom"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "q_later",
          "speaker": "q",
          "text": "行。我还没想好走哪边呢。你要走再叫我。",
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p_no",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
