      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cc_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cc_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "前面那扇窗很普通：一块空地，一道矮墙，绳子上夹着谁家晾的衣服。后面那扇窗拉着窗帘。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "布边一点光都不透。另一扇窗已经让落日照成金色。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "edges",
              "text": "先看看它是怎么挂的。",
              "next": "cc_edges_check",
              "conditions": {
                "not_flags": [
                  "check:classroom_curtain:cc_edges_check"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "draw",
              "text": "把它拉开。",
              "next": "cc_draw"
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "就让它拉着。",
              "next": "cc_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_edges_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "等一下。碰它之前，先看看下摆。",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 9,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "cc_edges_ok",
            "failure": "cc_edges_bad"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_edges_ok",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "它垂得笔直。这一侧应该有风，可下摆一下也没动过。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "curtain_hangs_still",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "开口前的蓝窗帘一动不动。"
            }
          ],
          "next": "cc_decide"
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_edges_bad",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "只是很厚的蓝布。一道道折在一起。",
          "next": "cc_decide"
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_decide",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你的手已经搭在布上了。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "draw",
              "text": "把它拉开。",
              "next": "cc_draw"
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "就让它拉着。",
              "next": "cc_leave"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_draw",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你伸手去拉那块布。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "curtain_fall_pending",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "drew_back_curtain",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你拉开了生物教室后窗的窗帘。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cc_leave",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你松了手。它垂回原样，一点没变。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "classroom_curtain_void": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cv_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cv_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "墙不见了，地板到这里就断了。没有玻璃，也看不见外面。落日照不到这里。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "saw_void_window",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "蓝帘后面是断开的墙，再往外什么也看不见。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cv_balance_check",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "脚尖下面就是尽头。你的重心在哪儿？",
          "check": {
            "ability": "orientation",
            "difficulty": 10,
            "kind": "visible",
            "success": "cv_hold",
            "failure": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cv_hold",
          "speaker": "voice_orientation",
          "text": "后脚。对，把重量放回后脚，退一步。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "classroom_curtain_drawn": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "ccd_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ccd_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "蓝帘还收在两边。墙到这里就断了，再往外什么也看不见。"
        },
        {
          "id": "ccd_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "这次你没有往前。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "classroom_curtain_step": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cs_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cs_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "那里还是空的。你已经知道脚下的地板在哪里断开。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "step",
              "text": "从开口下去。",
              "next": "cs_step"
            },
            {
              "id": "stay",
              "text": "留在教室。",
              "next": "cs_stay"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_step",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你低下身子，向前走出最后一步。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "curtain_fall_pending",
              "value": true
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        },
        {
          "id": "cs_stay",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你从边上退开。",
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "classroom_fall_landing": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "cl_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "cl_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "蓝色铁皮在脚下响了一声。抬头只有天，刚才的开口不见了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cl_safe",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "两脚都站住了。你直起身，身上哪里也不疼。",
          "conditions": {
            "not_flags": [
              "curtain_landing_injured"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cl_hurt",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "一只脚刚碰到铁皮就疼。你把手按在箱顶上，换另一只脚才站起来。",
          "conditions": {
            "all_flags": [
              "curtain_landing_injured"
            ]
          },
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "hurt_ankle_at_container",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你落在箱顶时伤了脚。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cl_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "箱侧有一部铁梯。再往外是球场、攀爬架、长椅和工具棚。是操场。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "playground_arrived",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "set_objective",
              "key": "objective.playground"
            },
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "fell_into_playground",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "你从蓝帘后的开口落下，掉在操场的蓝色集装箱顶上。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "classroom_rear_door": {
      "default_source": "observed",
      "subjective": false,
      "start": "rd_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "rd_1",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "那扇门打开，后面是墙：抹灰，和教室其他地方一样的漆，缩在门框里。"
        },
        {
          "id": "rd_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "而教室前面，刚才还什么都没有的地方，一段楼梯从天花板上伸下来，停在讲台前面，离地两米。"
        },
        {
          "id": "rd_3",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "没有东西托着它。它哪儿也不通，看上去也并不在意。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "record",
              "entry_id": "saw_suspended_stair",
              "source": "observed",
              "speaker": "protagonist",
              "text": "打开教室黑板墙上的另一扇门之后，教室里多了一段楼梯。它从天花板上垂下来，悬在讲台前面，什么也没托着它。"
            }
          ],
          "next": null
        }
      ]
    },
    "student": {
      "start": "st_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "st_1",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "你也坐这儿。",
          "next": "st_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "他说话时不看你，看的是桌面。手一直放在桌沿上，像在按住什么东西，不让它动。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "st_3"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_3",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "刚开学那两天，老师点名还得抬头找位置。现在不用了，一抬头就知道空着几张桌子。",
          "next": "st_4"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_4",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "你顺着他的视线看过去。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "st_5"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_5",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "别数。",
          "next": "st_ask"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_ask",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "他这才看了你一眼。",
          "source": "observed",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ask_moved",
              "text": "桌子是不是被搬动过？",
              "next": "st_moved"
            },
            {
              "id": "ask_quiet",
              "text": "你一直坐这儿？",
              "next": "st_quiet"
            },
            {
              "id": "ask_nothing",
              "text": "（不说话，等他自己说）",
              "next": "st_wait"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "st_moved",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "搬过。放假前有人进来重新排过一次。排完跟原来一模一样——连地上那圈印子都对得上。",
          "next": "st_m2"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_m2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "他说「一模一样」的时候，语气是平的，像在念一句背熟了的话。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "st_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_quiet",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "我的位置没变过。",
          "next": "st_q2"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_q2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "停了一下，他又补了一句。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "st_q3"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_q3",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "不过有时候我坐下，会觉得这张桌子比昨天矮一点点。抬一下头就又好了。",
          "next": "st_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_wait",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "……没什么。你会习惯的。",
          "next": "st_w2"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_w2",
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "text": "他把手从桌沿上拿开。桌上什么都没有，连一层灰也没有——那张桌子干净得像刚刚擦过。",
          "source": "observed",
          "next": "st_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "st_end",
          "speaker": "student",
          "text": "上课了。你回去坐着吧。",
          "next": null,
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_flag",
              "flag": "student_talked",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
